###1. gold.dim_customers

## Purpose: Stores customer information enriched with demographic and geographic details.

| Column Name       | Data Type    | Description                                                      |
| ----------------- | ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------    |
| `customer_id`     | INT          | Primary key Unique numerical identifier assigned to the customer.|
| `customer_number` | NVARCHAR(50) | Business identifier used to track and reference the customer.    |
| `first_name`      | NVARCHAR(50) | Customer's first name.                                           |
| `last_name`       | NVARCHAR(50) | Customer's last name.                                            |
| `country`         | NVARCHAR(50) | Customer's country of residence.                                 |
| `marital_status`  | NVARCHAR(50) | Customer's marital status, such as Married or Single.            |
| `gender`          | NVARCHAR(50) | Customer's gender.                                               |
| `birthdate`       | DATE         | Customer's date of birth.                                        |
| `create_date`     | DATE         | Date on which the customer record was created.                   |

