### 2. dim_Products

Purpose: Stores the current and integrated product information by combining CRM product data with ERP category details.

| Column Name      | Data Type | Description                                                    |
| ---------------- | --------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `product_id`     | INT       | Unique identifier of the product. Used as the **Primary Key**. |
| `product_number` | VARCHAR   | Business key/reference number used to identify the product.    |
| `product_name`   | VARCHAR   | Name of the product.                                           |
| `cost`           | INT       | Cost associated with the product.                              |
| `product_line`   | VARCHAR   | Product line or business segment of the product.               |
| `start_date`     | DATE      | Date from which the current product record became effective.   |
| `category_id`    | VARCHAR   | Identifier used to link the product with its category.         |
| `category`       | VARCHAR   | Main category of the product.                                  |
| `subcategory`    | VARCHAR   | More specific classification within the product category.      |
| `maintenance`    | VARCHAR   | Indicates whether the product requires maintenance.            |


