### 3.fact_Sales

Purpose: Stores sales transaction details from the CRM sales system, including order, product, customer, dates, sales amount, price, and quantity.

| Column Name      | Data Type | Description                                           |
| ---------------- | --------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| `order_number`   | VARCHAR   | Unique business reference number for the sales order. |
| `product_number` | VARCHAR   | Product business key identifying the product sold.    |
| `customer_id`    | INT       | Identifier of the customer who made the purchase.     |
| `order_date`     | DATE      | Date on which the sales order was placed.             |
| `shipping_date`  | DATE      | Date on which the order was shipped.                  |
| `due_date`       | DATE      | Date by which the order was expected to be delivered. |
| `sales_amount`   | INT       | Total sales amount generated from the transaction.    |
| `price`          | INT       | Price of the product at the time of the sale.         |
| `quantity`       | INT       | Number of units sold in the transaction.              |

